      "score": 9.0,
      "tick_range_start": 240,
      "tick_range_end": 420,
      "base_form": "Ambervale asked nothing of the Renn household that season, and the household gave it nothing worth recording either. The harvest came, the roof got patched, and that was the whole of it.",
