      "score": 7.5,
      "tick_range_start": 460,
      "tick_range_end": 900,
      "base_form": "Greymoor traded the same three ridgelines back and forth for the better part of a year. Neither the Kaine Dominion nor the Ostrel Concord could hold the pass long enough to fortify it, so both stopped trying.",
      "expanded_form": "Greymoor traded the same three ridgelines back and forth for the better part of a year. Neither the Kaine Dominion nor the Ostrel Concord could hold the pass long enough to fortify it, so both stopped trying. The truce that ended it was never signed, only observed, after Colonel Bran Ostwick simply stopped sending troops up the ridge.",
